# DEL against the fixture's one seed file, for the Storage chapter (Phase 3).
# Confirms the directory is empty afterward — proving DEL actually removed
# the entry, not just that the statement didn't error.
#
# The absent pattern requires at least one padding space between HELLO and
# .TXT (the directory listing's 8.3 field padding) so it doesn't trip on the
# zero-space "HELLO.TXT" literal echoed back from typing in line 10 itself.

console storage
send DIR\r
expect ^DELETED$
absent HELLO\s+\.TXT
